Feature: TC_11_ENTS - Transfer Application E2E Regression Pack (ETF Partner to Agent)

  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # Purpose:
  #   Single end-to-end regression journey covering Transfer of Entitlements flows where the Transferor is ETF partner
  #   agr15512 and the Transferee is a client herd of agent aga6581.
  #   KEY DIFFERENCE: the entitlement is typed in by hand (Add Manual Entitlement + Entitlement Type + Net UV) instead
  #   of picking a row, and the transferee search also takes the address line.
  #
  #   Transfer types covered:
  #     Section 1 : Change of Legal Entity (206)  - Selenium: C2057024 to B136017X (Darragh Staunton, Knockeevan Park)
  #     Section 2 : Change of Registration (205)  - Selenium: C2057024 to B1470189 (Simon Thornton, Tullycleave St)
  #     Section 3 : Lease                  (211)  - Selenium: C2057024 to B1870136 (Michael Mc Cullagh, Oranmore Pk) + lease year
  #     Section 4 : Gift                   (202)  - Selenium: C2057024 to D1460081 (Timothy Mangan, Ballybuggy Lawn)
  #     Section 5 : Merger                 (203)  - Selenium: C2057024 to D3320139 (Felix Mc Donagh, Ballyine Abbey)
  #     Section 6 : Division               (204)  - Selenium: C2057024 to B1470189 (Simon Thornton, Tullycleave St)
  #     Section 7 : Inheritance            (201)  - Selenium: C2057024 to B1870136 (Michael Mc Cullagh, Oranmore Pk)
  #     Section 8 : Sale                   (212)  - Selenium: C2057024 to D2760615 (Griffin Meats Ltd, Killnadrain Ave)
  #
  # Migrated from: TC_11_ENTS.feature (legacy 8 separate scenarios)
  #
  # Runtime data (Playwright, 30-09-2026):
  #   The transferee comes from the Agent Login pool of the agent in the transfereeAgent row (aga6581) and fills
  #     {transferee.herd}  {transferee.name}  {transferee.address}  {transferee.agent}
  #   The transferor comes from agr15512's own Agent Login pool ({transferor.herd}, EntsTestData.nextCrossAgentPair).
  #   The Selenium file used the partner's own herd C2057024 in every section: to do the same, put C2057024 back in the
  #   transferorHerd cell - the step then picks only the transferee (EntsTestData.nextTransfereeForFixedTransferor) and
  #   does not write the transferor to the used-herds file.
  #   Check first in SQL Developer that agr15512 has current herds: run the Agent Login query for agr15512, or pin C2057024.
  #   Every pick is written to runtime-data/ents_used_herds.csv and never reused. Put a herd number, name or login back
  #   in any cell to pin it for debugging (the Selenium values are in the comments of each section).
  #
  # Step reuse:
  #   ETF partner login + manual-entitlement create   -> stepdefinitions.ENTS.TC_11_ENTS
  #   Portal navigation                               -> stepdefinitions.TC_03
  #   Upload / send / key / submit                    -> stepdefinitions.ENTS.TC_01_ENTS
  #   Agent login (transferee) + acceptance           -> stepdefinitions.ENTS.TC_08_ENTS
  #   Tab switching                                   -> stepdefinitions.TC_06
  #
  #   Object Repository: iTransfereeAddressField, iTransferAddManualEntitlementBtn, iTransferEntitlementTypeDropdown and
  #   iTransferNetUVField must exist - the create step fails before its first click when one is missing.
  #
  # Author : Aniket Pathare | aniket.pathare@government.ie
  # Created: 31-03-2026 | Updated: 30-09-2026 (Playwright + runtime ENTS data)
  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Background:
    Given the ETF partner logs in as transferor "agr15512"
    And the agent opens the "Basic Income Support for Sustainability" application

  @regression @transfers @etf-to-agent @e2e
  Scenario: AT-ENTS-TRANSFERS-E2E-11 - ETF Partner completes all transfer types to Agent

    # ===========================================
    # SECTION 1 : Change of Legal Entity (206)
    # Selenium: C2057024 to B136017X (Darragh Staunton, Knockeevan Park)
    # ===========================================

    # --- Transferor (ETF Partner agr15512) ---
    When the ETF partner creates a transfer with manual entitlements
      | transferorHerd    | {transferor.herd}      |
      | transfereeHerd    | {transferee.herd}      |
      | transfereeName    | {transferee.name}      |
      | transfereeAddress | {transferee.address}   |
      | transfereeAgent   | aga6581                |
      | transferType      | Change of Legal Entity |
      | entitlements      | 0.01                   |
      | entitlementType   | BISS                   |
      | netUV             | 1                      |
      | notes             | Test Notes             |
    And the agent uploads the transferor signature document
    And the agent sends the transfer for acceptance
    Then the transfer key should be captured

    # --- Transferee (Agent aga6581) ---
    When the agent logs in as transferee agent "{transferee.agent}"
    And the agent navigates to the "Home" and "My Clients" Left Menu Link
    And the agent switches to the "Transfers" tab on the My Client page
    And the agent completes the same agent transferee acceptance flow
      | transfereeHerd | {transferee.herd} |
      | notes          | Approved Test     |
    Then the transfer should be submitted successfully

